  <item>
    <title>VOL.02｜陕北民歌的情情爱爱～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665393c34efbc0c3dc363b40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665393c34efbc0c3dc363b40</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【一起听歌吧～】</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 《一对对鸳鸯水上漂》</span></h2><span></span><p><span>一对对那个鸳鸯水那上漂</span></p><span></span><p><span>人家干那个都说是咱们两个好</span></p><span></span><p><span>你要是有那心思 咱就慢慢些交</span></p><span></span><p><span>你没有那心思儿呀就呀么就拉倒</span></p><span></span><p><span>你说那个拉倒就那拉倒&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>世上的那好人就有那多少</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁要是有那良心咱一辈辈好</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁没有那良心叫野鹊鹊掏</span></p><span></span><p><span>你对我那个好来我那知道&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像那个老羊疼那羊羔羔</span></p><span></span><p><span>墙头上跑了马呀还嫌低</span></p><span></span><p><span>咱面对面坐下呀还想你</span></p><span></span><p><span>想你的那个想成个泪人人</span></p><span></span><p><span>我抽签那个算卦我还问那神神</span></p><span></span><p><span>山了在水了在呀人常在</span></p><span></span><p><span>咱二人甚时候把天地拜</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a>《一个姐儿好人才》</span></h2><span></span><p><span>来了来了过来了&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>对面洼洼下来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>枣树林林上来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>哟嗬嗨下来了嗬嗨</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个那姐儿好人才</span></p><span></span><p><span>十人见了九人爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>你要来嗬你要来嗬</span></p><span></span><p><span>你要来你就早早价来</span></p><span></span><p><span>白萝卜卜胳膊水萝卜卜腿</span></p><span></span><p><span>瓜子仁仁舌头海棠花花脸</span></p><span></span><p><span>你要来嗬你要来嗬</span></p><span></span><p><span>双扇扇门来我单扇扇开</span></p><span></span><p><span>哟嗬嗨</span></p><span></span><p><span>对面峁峁上过来了过来了哟嗬咳</span></p><span></span><p><span>咳哎咳</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 《说不下个日子你不要走》</span></h2><span></span><p><span>一把把拉住呀哥哥你的手哎</span></p><span></span><p><span>说不下那日子呀你不要走</span></p><span></span><p><span>你管你走了丢下我一个</span></p><span></span><p><span>你咋狠心叫妹妹呀受呀受恓惶</span></p><span></span><p><span>挑起那扁担呀短下一只桶</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和呀那枕头呀短下一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span>凉席那冷炕我不想坐</span></p><span></span><p><span>我思前呀想后我不呀不想活</span></p>]]></description>
